/*
 * Empty override of Starlight's `ThemeSelect`.
 *
 * The Adler SPA is dark-only by design (see
 * `adler-server/web/src/ui/tokens.css`: `color-scheme: dark`), so a
 * light/dark switcher on the docs would be inconsistent with the
 * product. Replacing the component with a no-op file hides the
 * switcher from the page header while leaving the rest of Starlight's
 * navigation chrome intact.
 */
